 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Missile Fist — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, when you use your Missile Fist, you can spend additional cursed energy up to your Cursed Energy modifier to make an additional <em>Missile Fist</em> attack per cursed energy spent. Additionally, the range of your <em>Missile Fists</em> increases to 30 ft. This range increases by 20 ft again at 6th, 11th, and 18th level.</p>\n<p>If you hit a creature that is Large or smaller with a <em>Missile Fist</em>, instead of dealing damage, you can choose to grapple it for 1 minute. If you hit a grappled creature that is Large or smaller with a <em>Missile Fist</em>, instead of dealing damage, you can choose to restrain it for 1 minute. A creature can make a Strength saving throw against your CE save DC at the end of their turn to escape your technique. On a success, they can remove one of the <em>Missile Fists</em>, removing either the Grappled or Restrained conditions. These conditions end if you become Incapacitated.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
